{"id": "EUVD-2026-108326", "enisaUuid": "0ec821ec-9cbe-3cd4-9476-9752d76e7ff6", "description": "Wasmtime before 24.0.13, 25.0.0 before 36.0.14, 37.0.0 before 46.0.3, and 47.0.0 before 47.0.4 allows a filesystem sandbox escape in wasmtime-wasi because its cap-std dependency mishandles symlinks with trailing slashes on macOS and Linux kernels lacking openat2. A guest with write access to any sandboxed directory can read and write any host-accessible file, and read-only guests may read host files via preexisting symlinks.", "datePublished": "2026-10-22T19:13:58", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T19:13:58", "baseScore": 8.8, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:L/UI:P/VC:H/VI:H/VA:L/SC:H/SI:H/SA:L", "references": ["https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-vqjp-4c8c-hfgg", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/wasmtime-before-24.0.13-25.0.0-before-36.0.14-37.0.0-before-46.0.3-and-47.0.0-before-47.0.4-sandbox-escape-via-trailing-slashes"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-115392", "GHSA-gxhv-gf3j-vwqc"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "120244e2-9c37-31d3-b8a1-e736dc01f0b9", "product": {"name": "wasmtime", "vendor": {"name": "bytecodealliance"}}, "product_version": "47.0.0 <47.0.4"}, {"id": "3a132c71-0e80-323a-93b9-6351dc49b123", "product": {"name": "wasmtime", "vendor": {"name": "bytecodealliance"}}, "product_version": "37.0.0 <46.0.3"}, {"id": "69ecba4d-bf13-3e70-9fa7-eb5e49495c3c", "product": {"name": "wasmtime", "vendor": {"name": "bytecodealliance"}}, "product_version": "25.0.0 <36.0.14"}, {"id": "e36ac31d-bf60-3e22-a3a5-8c62f36a1ea9", "product": {"name": "wasmtime", "vendor": {"name": "bytecodealliance"}}, "product_version": "0 <24.0.13"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "5079be3a-2305-3940-ab1c-4305267a6a7e", "vendor": {"name": "bytecodealliance"}}], "isExploited": false}